# AI Integration Guidelines

## AI Classes and Components
The framework includes comprehensive AI capabilities in [Brain/Classes/AI/](mdc:Brain/Classes/AI/):

### Core AI Components
- [Brain/Classes/AI/NLPProcessor.php](mdc:Brain/Classes/AI/NLPProcessor.php) - Natural Language Processing
- [Brain/Classes/AI/SentimentAnalyzer.php](mdc:Brain/Classes/AI/SentimentAnalyzer.php) - Sentiment analysis
- [Brain/Classes/AI/RecommendationEngine.php](mdc:Brain/Classes/AI/RecommendationEngine.php) - Recommendation systems
- [Brain/Classes/AI/AnomalyDetector.php](mdc:Brain/Classes/AI/AnomalyDetector.php) - Anomaly detection
- [Brain/Classes/AI/PredictiveCache.php](mdc:Brain/Classes/AI/PredictiveCache.php) - Predictive caching

## AI Module Structure
The framework includes an AI module in [Body/ai/](mdc:Body/ai/):
- Controllers for AI operations
- Models for AI data management
- Views for AI interfaces
- Route configurations for AI endpoints

