- [Brain/Classes/IoT/Data/StreamProcessor.php](mdc:Brain/Classes/IoT/Data/StreamProcessor.php) - Real-time data processing
- [Brain/Classes/IoT/Data/TelemetryCollector.php](mdc:Brain/Classes/IoT/Data/TelemetryCollector.php) - Data collection
- [Brain/Classes/IoT/Data/TimeSeriesDB.php](mdc:Brain/Classes/IoT/Data/TimeSeriesDB.php) - Time series storage

### IoT Intelligence
